    "buildName": "WRAITH WALKER",
    "buildAuthor": "Velkyn",
    "buildCategory": 0,
    "buildDescription": "Wraith hits taunt enemies off you with no Combat Condition Resistance check. Wraiths are damage-immune, so each one soaks aggro for its full 3 s. Wraith count, reach and arc decide survival, unlike freeze or knockback.\n\nReused wraiths roll their old Rapid Attack Chance against the self-kill timer, which can cut some to 0.75 s instead of 3 s. So this build takes no Rapid Attack Chance.\n\nNo cap on living wraiths; the limit is dash speed. A dash makes (1 + min(2, Ally Summon Amount)) x 5, at most 15. Chain-dashing for 3 s peaks near 45 alive: back-to-back banked charges, or Golden Feather at 100% refund. With normal recharge the average is about 23, about 25 at Recharge +520%. A burst from 5 banked charges peaks near 45 for a few seconds, then falls to the recharge-limited rate.\n\nGolden Feather loses the i-frames, a core survival part together with the 3 s aggro. It fits Normal or Shattered Rituals when paired with high Proc Chance before mid tiers.",
